  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "阮ê竹塹 阮ê玻璃"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>陳彥汝</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">眠夢中ê恬靜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雄雄hōo出聲ê</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">玻璃phuè攪吵--起-來</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">甜but-but</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">鹹tok-tok</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">酸giuh-giuh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">苦teh-teh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">喙底ê鹹酸苦tsiánn lóng總無味--ah</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮ê目睭kan-na看著</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">五花十色ê玻璃</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">花pa-li-niau ê玻璃&nbsp;</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">燒冷koh再燒冷</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">幾百度ê hip熱</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">拚勢ê溫度</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">妝thānn出lè-táu ê玻璃</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī規年thàng天透風ê竹塹</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">帶來濟濟ê人客&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hōo逐家趁錢huānn家</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">用伊上美麗ê影跡</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiNr0ZKm51Ecb8-KEIGF18wtrYcQFygzRnplKd4oYjUeZ-FMR8vwWb9WnVmaoWKATLADn63MJqOR6ktAGxHJ8-37XvdH_loCCUPTDxE82yci0-IUMLnkxgk82ooammZFu9VMSm3ZRqXiurb8VrXAe_2LFst9kUoS6VgdRnAlwWrht38nDjJ6y49pjzcby5p/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_5.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiNr0ZKm51Ecb8-KEIGF18wtrYcQFygzRnplKd4oYjUeZ-FMR8vwWb9WnVmaoWKATLADn63MJqOR6ktAGxHJ8-37XvdH_loCCUPTDxE82yci0-IUMLnkxgk82ooammZFu9VMSm3ZRqXiurb8VrXAe_2LFst9kUoS6VgdRnAlwWrht38nDjJ6y49pjzcby5p/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1364%E6%9C%9F_5.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhsf1C8AxcViI33baYqYE9-duHiaJ4etMrxpIoh1SPcDPRmBRnFrMA4ZBDWHfA7Im9MR8yMjYayG2oLAwbIL-WOr_tKjYVJ-ezF1YbAGmcplqncQBh8fBzbVyWzCafMOiZKt9c-2j-nQP4f3wq610s86bmcPnWPvua8B8_dFHiPAKEx1_mftm8ObyHQO149